  "description": "MCP server for the intelligent rollback sample. AWS DevOps Agent calls it over MCP Streamable HTTP at the API Gateway endpoint below, signed with AWS SigV4. The two READ_ONLY tools run during an investigation; the three MUTATIVE tools run only as directed actions that an operator approves in chat.",
